// Knowledge Check question banks (15 per ACORD form). Students must pass the module's Knowledge Check
// (after completing the training video) before they can start the fillable-PDF assessment.
//
// All questions (ACORD 125, 126, 127, 130 and 140) are taken from the modules' training videos; `at` is the
// timestamp (mm:ss) where the topic is covered and is shown to students in the answer review.
// Transcripts of the videos: supabase/knowledge-checks/transcripts/*.txt
//
// Regenerate the SQL after editing:   node supabase/knowledge-checks/build.mjs
//
// Each question: key (stable id), at (video timestamp), q (question), options (2-6 choices),
// answer (0-based index of the correct option), why (explanation shown after the student passes).
// Answers never reach the browser until the student has passed.

